{
  "project": {
    "name": "Side-Opening Top",
    "slug": "side-opening-top",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "engine": "fc",
    "description": {
      "en": "An adaptive pull-on-free top: a relaxed front + back where one side seam and the matching sleeve underarm open fully, closed by a run of magnetic clasps, so the garment can be dressed one-handed or seated without raising the arms overhead. The magnetic-clasp solid bridges to Yantra4D `magnetic-clasp`. Fashion Cabinet owns the garment + clasp placement. FC-200 long-tail (adaptive).\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Fashion Cabinet",
      "es": "Un top adaptativo sin necesidad de meterlo por la cabeza: un frente + espalda holgados donde una costura lateral y el bajo manga se abren por completo, cerrados por una hilera de broches magnéticos, para vestirlo con una mano o sentado sin levantar los brazos. El broche se puentea al `magnetic-clasp` de Yantra4D. Fashion Cabinet posee la prenda + la colocación de broches. Cola larga FC-200 (adaptativo).\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Fashion Cabinet"
    },
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": [
      "adaptive",
      "inclusive",
      "top",
      "one-handed",
      "magnetic",
      "hardware",
      "commons",
      "made-to-measure"
    ],
    "attribution": {
      "author": "Innovaciones MADFAM",
      "license": "LicenseRef-FC1-pending",
